@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Heldt can improve our relationships with our coalition partners.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and aspd_in_government = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government: The SPD is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if spd_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; z_relation += 5; ddp_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5

We have improved our relations with the WP, [+ ddp_name +], and DVP, and reduced tensions with the coalition.


@Campaigning
title: Nationalist campaigning
subtitle: Heldt is a supporter of nationalism, even if oportunistically.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_toleration: The SPD is not in toleration. ?]
choose-if:advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: Q.nationalism + 2 =; old_middle_aspd += 3*(1 - dissent); National_revolutionary_dissent -= 5; national_revolutionary_strenght += 5; [? if proletarian_conciousness = 1: workers_aspd += 2*(1 - dissent) ?]
We ramp up nationalist campaigning, the middle classes [? if proletarian_conciousness = 1: and the workers ?]. are receptive to our party

@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; National_revolutionary_dissent -= 5; Coalitionist_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10;

We have enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions.

